'''Wrathful Poseidon''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties: The Majestic Zeus]] event and the [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]] increases his speed, health, and attack power. [[Talents]] were also added in Version 9.10.

